Bubble rect y386-423, token face y427. So bubble is above Luna's face. In the screenshot, bubble at y~430? Maybe I misread due screenshot scaling. Looking again: PlayGround room starts around y=360. Bubble around y=430? The face below at y~485 might be Luna? Wait Luna y427, Sol y454. The visible face below bubble could be Luna (at 427?). Hmm, the screenshot is 390x844, and face under bubble at maybe ~480. Token y427 should be ~427. So probably the visible face is Sol at y454 and Luna at 427 is just hidden behind the bubble bottom edge? Bubble ends y423, face starts 427 — should be visible. So the upper face at ~430 is Luna, and the lower at ~480 is Sol; they overlap (Luna y427-459, Sol y454-486 → 5px overlap). In the screenshot I see two faces? Looking closely: there is a face with glasses under bubble — that's Sol; and above perhaps Luna's face hidden behind bubble? Actually Luna is at 427 so her face would overlap the bubble's bottom pointer slightly? No.

